0026:     - Copy the input grid.
0027:     - For row r below the top, fill columns span_left + r through span_right - r.
0028:     - Each filled cell takes the top-row color r columns up-left, flipped red<->grey once per row step.
0029: 
0030:     Key insight:
0031:     - The output is the top-row span propagated down-right along diagonals, while the allowable region shrinks inward from both ends each row.
0032:     """
